{
  "$description": "PsConnector design tokens in the W3C design tokens (DTCG) format, as Figma Tokens Studio reads and writes it: token sets \"core\" (sizes, fonts, icons), \"dark\" and \"light\" (colours), and two themes. The viewer (crates/psconnector-view/build.rs) and design/tokens.css are generated from this file. See design/README.md.",
